    <p class="section-sub">Most branding agencies give you a colour palette and wave goodbye. We give you an AI-powered business.</p>

    <div class="diff-grid">
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">Inside Out</div>
        <h3>We Start With Inner Work</h3>
        <p>Before a single pixel is designed, we understand who you are at your core — your voice, your values, your purpose. The brand we build IS you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">AI Agents</div>
        <h3>Custom Agents, Not Generic Tools</h3>
        <p>Your agents are trained on YOUR voice from the discovery session. They don't sound like AI — they sound like you on your best day. And they get better over time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">4-Pillar Visibility</div>
        <h3>Optimized for AI Search</h3>
        <p>Every page is built with The ELEVATE Method — SEO, AEO, GEO, and LLMO. You show up in Google, AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity from launch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">Autopilot</div>
        <h3>It Runs Without You</h3>
        <p>Content creation, social scheduling, email sequences, calendar management, lead scoring — agents handle the repetitive work so you can focus on coaching.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">Your Voice</div>
        <h3>No Brand Personas</h3>
        <p>We don't give you a "brand voice." We extract YOUR voice and train AI agents to use it. Everything they create sounds like you wrote it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal">
        <div class="tag">ROI</div>
        <h3>Replaces a $90K/Year Team</h3>
        <p>Content writer, social media manager, VA, SEO consultant — your AI agents do what that team does, for a one-time investment that pays for itself in weeks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── FAQ ─── -->
<section class="reveal" style="background:var(--bg-alt)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Questions</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked</h2>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What exactly are the AI agents?</h3>
        <p>Custom automation workflows trained on your voice and brand. They run on platforms like Paperclip, n8n, or Make — connected to your website, social accounts, email provider, and calendar. Think of them as a team that works 24/7 and sounds exactly like you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How long does the whole process take?</h3>
        <p>Foundation: 3 weeks. Launch: 4 weeks. Visibility: 5 weeks + 3 months ongoing. We build fast but never rush — your brand and agents need to be right.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Will the agents actually sound like me?</h3>
        <p>Yes. During discovery, we record how you naturally talk about your work. We extract your verbal patterns, favourite phrases, and sentence rhythm. Every agent is trained on this voice profile. We test with 3 sample outputs per agent and refine until you can't tell the difference.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What do I need to provide?</h3>
        <p>Just yourself. Show up to the discovery session, give us access to your accounts, and provide feedback on drafts and agent outputs. We handle all the building, connecting, and testing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can I pay in instalments?</h3>
        <p>Yes. 2-payment plans (50/50) on all tiers. 3-payment plans (40/30/30) on Visibility. Monthly payment plans also available with a small premium.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What happens after the project is done?</h3>
        <p>You own everything — the brand, the website, and all agent configurations. Foundation and Launch clients can continue with our Ongoing Growth plan ($197/month) for agent maintenance and content support. Visibility clients get 3 months included, then can continue monthly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What is The ELEVATE Method?</h3>
        <p>Our 4-pillar search visibility framework: SEO (Google rankings), AEO (AI Overviews and Featured Snippets), GEO (Google AI generative citations), and LLMO (ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Claude recommendations). Most agencies only do SEO. We optimize for all four.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What if I already have a website?</h3>
        <p>We can rebuild or optimize what you have. During the discovery session, we'll assess whether a refresh or full rebuild makes more sense. Either way, your AI agents get connected to whatever platform you're on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

